    "body": "The earlier horse-wheel guard covered carried-mask synchronization but left shared ammo-cap maintenance running. This crash occurred while the horse weapon page was committing a rifle selection; the direct ammo selector did not fire, and the carried-mask log confirms its guard was active. `updateSharedAmmoCaps` was still calling `SET_MAX_AMMO_OVERRIDE` for enabled ammo families every 250 ms during Rockstar's live equip transaction.\n\nThe wheel-and-settle guard now covers carried-mask synchronization and all shared ammo/item-cap maintenance. The corrected ASI is installed and hash-verified:\n\n`B91987788C09D508BAEFB88E0E0223D8B599EF7785B169B963E6F38F0573B271`\n\nRuntime check remaining: retrieve/change horse weapons repeatedly and confirm the wheel closes and equips without ERROR:FFFFFFFF.",
